--[[====================================================================
    GRAVITY DUMPER  -  Anime Fighters Simulator
    Saves what the game looks like from your client so Gravity Hub can be
    fixed from real data instead of guesses.

    Everything goes to:  <executor workspace>/GravityHub/AFS/dump/
      summary.txt      executor, place, your world, counts, missing functions
      remotes.txt      every RemoteEvent / RemoteFunction / Bindable (path + class)
      player.txt       your player: values, attributes, pets (first 3 with their Data)
      server_*.txt     answers of read-only server calls (GetPetData, ...)
      gui.txt          PlayerGui.MainGui (visible / hidden, button + label text)
      world.txt        the world you're standing in, deep, + one enemy in full
      near.txt         every map piece / enemy within 1500 studs of you, not grouped
      modes.txt        Dungeon / Raid / Tower / InfinityTower / GatesMode / ... maps
      replicated.txt   ReplicatedStorage tree
      workspace.txt    Workspace tree (same-named things grouped)
      modules/<name>.txt   data of every ModuleScripts module (require)
      calls.txt        RECORD: every remote call you make + what the server
                       sends back, while recording is on

    How to use
      1. Run this (Gravity Hub can stay open).
      2. Press "Dump All" where you normally farm. Wait for "done".
      3. Press "Record", then do by hand ONE of each thing that is broken:
         open a dungeon, join a time trial, join a raid / defense / gate,
         start a quest, mount, hatch a star. Then press "Stop + Save".
      4. Send the dump folder (or tell Claude where it is on your PC).
======================================================================]]

